13:48:52  == Installing ClaudeOS next to macOS
13:48:52  The Asahi installer makes room next to macOS and installs ClaudeOS's base (Fedora Linux) there. Setup
13:48:52  answers its questions. When it asks for your Mac's password, type it (it stays hidden) and press Enter.
13:48:52  It takes about 10 to 20 minutes; your Mac may seem to freeze while macOS's partition shrinks. That's normal.
